our Hong&#160;Kong subsidiaries to distribute earnings outside Hong&#160;Kong, certain daily remittance limits will be imposed by Hong&#160;Kong
laws and processing banks. Additionally, such remittances should not be used for money laundering or terrorist financing purposes. Registered
institutes, such as banks, have their own internal policies, procedures and controls in the relevant operational areas so as to meet
their anti-money laundering and counter-financing of terrorism statutory and regulatory requirements and guard against money laundering
and terrorist financing.</span></p><div>

