    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    operating subsidiaries invest in sponsored advertisements on online selling platforms to reach customers interested in purchasing
    toner cartridges to improve the brand recognition of the operating subsidiaries, grow customers and boost sales.</span></td></tr>
