    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Through
    providing customer services on a timely basis and constantly improving the quality of their services to online retail customers,
    the operating subsidiaries aim to build and improve their brand reputation and boost word-of-mouth marketing.</span></td></tr>
