    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the
    requirement that we have a nominating and corporate governance committee and a compensation committee that are composed entirely
    of independent directors with a written charter addressing the purposes and responsibilities of the committees.</span></td></tr>
