    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">exercising
    the borrowing powers of our company and mortgaging the property of our company; and</span></td></tr>
