    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the
    act complained of, although not <i>ultra vires,</i> could only be effected duly if authorized by more than the number of votes which
    have actually been obtained; and</span></td></tr>
