have <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" format="ixt:fixed-true" name="ecd:InsiderTrdPoliciesProcAdoptedFlag" id="ixv-34145">adopted</ix:nonNumeric> insider trading policies governing the purchase, sale, and other dispositions of our securities by directors, senior management,
