consolidated financial statements include the financial statements of the Company and its subsidiaries. All intercompany transactions
and balances among the Company and its subsidiaries have been eliminated upon consolidation.</span></p></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></span></p>

