plant and equipment are stated at cost less accumulated depreciation and impairment, if any, and depreciated on a straight-line basis
over the estimated useful lives of the assets as follows:</span></p></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

