<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company&#8217;s authorized share capital is comprised of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34945">2,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares, <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c3" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34946">1,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Class B ordinary shares,
and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34947">800,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Preferred shares of par value HK$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="hkdPershares" id="ixv-34948">0.0001</ix:nonFraction> each.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Holders
of Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares have the same rights except for voting, transfer and conversion rights. Each Class
A ordinary share is entitled to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c241" name="us-gaap:CommonStockVotingRights" id="ixv-34949">one</ix:nonNumeric> vote, and each Class B ordinary share is entitled to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c242" name="us-gaap:CommonStockVotingRights" id="ixv-34950">ten</ix:nonNumeric> votes. Each Class B ordinary share is convertible
into <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="yibo:ConvertibleCommonShares" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34951">one</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary share at any time by the holder thereof, while Class A ordinary shares are not convertible into Class B ordinary
shares under any circumstances.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
January 29, 2024, the Company closed its initial public offering on the Nasdaq Capital Market where <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c243" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34952">1,250,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares
were newly issued at a price of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c244" decimals="1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-34953">4.0</ix:nonFraction> per share with the total net proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c245" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceInitialPublicOffering" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-34954">4,305</ix:nonFraction>. With the success of the IPO, the mezzanine equity
in the total amount of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c246" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueOther" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-34955">14,104</ix:nonFraction> was converted into <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c247" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34956">10,526,300</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares as permanent equity.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2024 and 2025, the number of the Company&#8217;s authorized Class A ordinary shares was <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c8" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34957"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34958">2,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>, and the number
of the Company&#8217;s issued Class A ordinary shares was <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c25" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34959">27,565,800</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34960">32,918,421</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. As of December 31, 2024 and 2025,
the number of the Company&#8217;s authorized Class B ordinary shares was <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c26" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34961">1,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction>, and issued Class B ordinary shares was <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c38" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-34962">26,315,800</ix:nonFraction>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></span></p>

